        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-398 (ensure controlled execution — Delivery Performance &amp; SLA Management (PA-56.2).) | - CTL-398 (route-optimization accuracy); operational: Logistics Manager daily sign-off
Owner: DC Dispatch Supervisor</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
